  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You regularly take precautions to keep your fur and your well-being healthy. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against diseases at all times, but you can be meticulous when you need to be. While Exploring, you can take ten minutes to bathe, clean, find herbal remedies or use earthen dust to help root out diseases in your body, increasing this bonus to a +2 to your next saving throw against one ongoing affliction (including if it was not a disease). You can only apply this bonus once per affliction per 24 hours.</span></p>"
